# ── Trivy Vulnerability Exception List ─────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Documented exception mechanism for Trivy container security scans.
# Vulnerabilities listed here will be ignored by CI scan steps.
#
# Rules for adding exceptions:
# 1. State the CVE / GHSA identifier.
# 2. State the affected package and current version.
# 3. Justify why the risk is acceptable (e.g. not reachable in runtime,
#    no patch available upstream yet, or mitigated by runtime policy).
# 4. Include an expiry/review date.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-0000 # Package: libxyz; Justification: not invoked at runtime; Review: 2026-12-01
